WEBVTT

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:03.940
<i>In search of the mysterious puppet master 
behind the demonic activity,</i>

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:06.230
<i>I used a device 
I'd invented in my past life</i>

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:10.990
<i>to discover that the perpetrator 
was the high-ranking demon, Zardias.</i>

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:14.460
<i>We were incapable of fighting him 
at our current levels of power.</i>

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:17.040
<i>Nevertheless, we refused to give up</i>

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:20.490
<i>and headed for the royal capital to find 
a magical blade we could use to oppose him.</i>

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:24.460
<i>On our way there, 
the seal holding him broke.</i>

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:27.850
<i>Lurie and Alma went to fetch
the magic sword from the treasury,</i>

00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:31.560
<i>while Iris and I remained behind 
to hold off Zardias.</i>

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:32.460
<i>However...</i>

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:36.520
Is this all the strongest 
in the world has to offer?

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:39.140
I suppose I should finish the job!

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:41.910
<i>Then, in order to win this battle,</i>

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:45.350
<i>I'll have to give up my life!</i>

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:20.990
<b>Episode 12</b>

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:20.990
<b>The Strongest Sage Goes on a Journey Again.</b>

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:26.180
Not this one.

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:28.120
Not this one, either.

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:29.910
Or this one...

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:34.040
I'm getting something!

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:35.340
Great job, Lurie!

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:38.200
I think it's inside this box.

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:39.550
Open it, quick!

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:40.590
Right.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:50.850
I can sense the incredible
magic power within it.

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:52.700
This must be...

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:53.840
Let's hurry!

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:55.230
Right!

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:57.940
<i>We're on our way, Matty!</i>

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:06.440
How foolish of you.

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:12.560
You thought 
that you could buy time against me with such meager power?

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:23.260
I know exactly what you're after.

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:28.040
You're making preparations 
inside the barrier to resist me.

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:30.020
That's why you have to protect it.

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:34.900
As long as this powerful barrier 
remains in place,

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:37.940
my subordinates cannot enter.

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:43.930
But what about those 
who were already inside when it was erected?

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.540
<i>Can it be...</i>

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:55.680
Matty's magic signature is growing weaker!

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:57.010
We have to hurry!

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:57.800
Right!

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:01.340
A demon?

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:03.220
But how? 
We're inside the barrier!

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:05.360
Could that be the one—

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:09.350
I will not waste the life 
that Lord Zardias bestowed upon me!

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:13.320
I will finish you here!

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:16.980
Alma!

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:18.570
Leave it to me!

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:22.290
Such petty tricks won't work on me!

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.160
We did it, Lurie!

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:34.660
Are you all right?

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.610
Yeah, I'm all right.

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:39.920
I'm sorry that I doubted you earlier.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:41.860
Don't worry about it.

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:44.700
Forget about me. 
Take that weapon and—

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:46.640
And give it to me.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:51.600
On the orders of Lord Zardias, 
I will finish you here and now.

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:56.040
<i>Another demon! 
There's another one here?</i>

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:59.440
<i>I'm not sensing 
any more demonic magical signatures.</i>

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:01.540
<i>We just need to defeat this demon, and...</i>

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:03.930
I will ask you this once:

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:08.900
Surrender your weapons and give me 
what you took from the treasury right now.

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:10.280
If you refuse...

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:18.190
Sorry, Lurie. Alma.

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:19.970
He caught us.

00:05:19.970 --> 00:05:22.760
I won't be as easily disposed of 
as Deshril.

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:28.120
<i>Demonic signatures inside the barrier...</i>

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:29.680
<i>I can't believe it.</i>

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:33.820
You resurrected the bodies of the demons 
we had stored inside the capital?

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:38.270
Yeah, I magically ordered them 
to slay your companions.

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:44.230
And they shall continue their work 
for me, until their borrowed lives end.

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:49.090
<i>He's after the barrier again!</i>

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:51.490
<i>Defensive spells won't be enough 
to block it!</i>

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:55.250
Is protecting the barrier 
all you want to focus on?

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:04.090
Matthias!

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:10.250
Why don't you wake up already?

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:12.720
The reason you can't exercise your full power

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:16.170
is that you keep covering 
for those weaklings.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:22.250
Just abandon 
those worthless peons already.

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:23.860
Cast everything else aside,

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:26.780
and show me what humanity's strongest 
really has to offer!

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:31.700
Well, what now?

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:33.440
Don't do it!

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:36.020
Don't worry about us! 
Just beat him!

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.380
Stop it!

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:40.620
I will, if you do as I ask.

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:43.590
Or are you willing 
to simply watch them die?

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:54.430
I hope Lurie and Alma found the sword.

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:56.450
<i>If the magic sword doesn't reach me in time,</i>

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:58.810
<i>there will be nothing 
to stop the total destruction of humanity.</i>

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:00.980
<i>I don't have much magic power left.</i>

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:02.580
Well, what now?

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:04.780
You've put up a good struggle,

00:07:04.780 --> 00:07:07.300
but you no longer have 
any hope of victory.

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:11.410
<i>If I give up on this fight...</i>

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:16.740
<i>I can use my remaining life and magical power 
to activate the reincarnation spell.</i>

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:20.000
<i>Reincarnating over again in the next era 
is one potential option.</i>

00:07:20.380 --> 00:07:21.880
<i>In the next era,</i>

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:24.340
<i>his own power will have
weakened at least a little.</i>

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:28.790
<i>I can improve my skills 
in magical combat and plot a comeback.</i>

00:07:29.730 --> 00:07:32.700
<i>That would be the smartest option.</i>

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:35.120
<i>It would mean the end 
of this current civilization, but...</i>

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:36.560
But...

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:39.600
We know that you can win!

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:41.730
We believe in you!

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:45.760
What's wrong? Finished already?

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:47.570
It's not finished until I say it is.

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:53.060
My counterattack has just begun!

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:56.120
Fool.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:57.960
No sudden moves, now.

00:07:57.960 --> 00:08:00.040
Unless you want to see the hostages—

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:03.660
Sorry we're late!

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:05.800
Headmaster!

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:06.860
Guys!

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:10.220
Second Academy exists 
to protect the capital!

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:14.430
You may have more forces, 
but I still have hostages!

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.390
Spell Shatter?!

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:21.910
Matty's taught us a lot of tricks!

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:27.710
Students! 
Initiate counter-demon tactics!

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:28.690
Right!

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:32.850
Go on! 
Leave this to us!

00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:33.880
Right!

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:40.990
<i>I can channel my life energy into magic power 
to increase my combat potential!</i>

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:45.460
<i>It's a last resort...</i>

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:49.500
I'll put my faith in Lurie and Alma 
and use this to hold out!

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:53.220
More cheap tricks.

00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:56.770
Iris, fly me right in front of him!

00:08:56.770 --> 00:08:58.430
Right!

00:08:58.430 --> 00:08:59.890
Dragon's Breath!

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:02.100
Here we go!

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:10.120
It will always end the same way!

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:12.650
Matthias!

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:15.260
Iris!

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:17.380
Could you get him that sword already?

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:20.330
Matty!

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.160
Take it!

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:42.600
Matty...

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.900
What a pity.

00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:48.500
Turning your back on enemy 
in a fight

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:51.570
is the same as asking them 
to kill you!

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:54.700
No way...

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:59.560
Matty...

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:04.790
Matty!

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:14.320
What's... going on?

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:16.110
How?!

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:18.800
I pierced your heart!

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:21.620
Yes, and killed me.

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:24.310
That's what activated the sword's ability.

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:25.810
What?!

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:29.560
Then I need only kill you again!

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:33.440
Matty... Amazing!

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:40.450
<i>The sword represents the pinnacle 
of my craft from my past life.</i>

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:44.080
<i>The condition for its activation 
is loss of the wielder's life.</i>

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:49.040
<i>And its effect, revival of the wielder 
and a tremendous infusion of magic!</i>

00:10:49.740 --> 00:10:51.190
He's faster than before!

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:52.380
Damn!

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:57.050
<i>But the magic is so intense, 
I can only barely control it.</i>

00:10:57.050 --> 00:11:00.820
<i>If I fail, 
I could turn the entire area to ash!</i>

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:02.180
<i>Before that happens...</i>

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:06.790
You may have increased your magical power,

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:10.050
but your battered body 
won't hold out for long!

00:11:10.050 --> 00:11:12.460
With this much magical power, 
my physical body is irrelevant.

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:17.780
I can simply animate it 
with magic alone.

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:20.450
Just as you did 
to your demon companions.

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:23.360
How can you use such a technique?

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:26.410
No human should be capable of it!

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:29.000
I was sure I was the strongest 
in the world!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.740
Who exactly are you?!

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:33.950
I am Matthias Hildesheimer.

00:11:35.050 --> 00:11:39.130
The strongest sage with the weakest crest!

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:50.580
I may have lost,

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:55.780
but I am not the only chaos demon 
in this world.

00:11:56.860 --> 00:12:02.760
The next demon shall surely destroy you.

00:12:11.260 --> 00:12:13.880
Well, at least
 that's one dispatch complete.

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:14.750
Right?

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:19.520
Matty!

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:22.900
Ow, ow, ow...

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:24.140
Lurie...

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:29.080
I'm so glad you're alive!

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:32.060
<i>Is it because I almost died?</i>

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:34.230
<i>I feel like she's letting herself 
get closer than usual...</i>

00:12:34.780 --> 00:12:36.610
Matty! You're bleeding! 
You're bleeding!

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:38.230
He's dying! He's dying!

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:42.610
I-I'm okay. It's because I only cast 
the most basic healing spell on myself.

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:43.960
But...

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:47.310
<i>I can't admit it's because
I was excited over Lurie...</i>

00:12:47.310 --> 00:12:49.340
It appears it's all over.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.320
Headmaster!

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:53.520
Did you all make it through?

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:54.430
Yes.

00:12:54.430 --> 00:12:57.170
The students took care of the demon 
in the barrier.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.590
No casualties at all.

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:02.630
Though we did destroy 
quite a few of the surrounding buildings...

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:06.090
Then we'd better hurry up 
and repair the damage we did.

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:08.120
I'll help, too!

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:09.060
Me, too!

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:10.790
Me, too!

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:13.220
I'd appreciate that.

00:13:13.220 --> 00:13:16.850
First things first, 
I should really expel its magic power.

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:19.130
This magic sword is one-use-only.

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:21.480
A one-use magic sword?

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:30.350
Er... Matthias...

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:35.710
There we go.

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:37.580
All back to normal.

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:42.170
Though it may take a little while longer 
to recover my magic power.

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:44.630
This is where Matty's room is, right?

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:46.180
Hush! Be quiet!

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:48.250
He might still be sleeping!

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:50.500
I'm sure he's up by now!

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:53.180
But he was fighting so hard!

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:56.640
And when I picture his face 
while he's sleeping...

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:59.040
What are we up to?

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:02.510
Can't get the door open, huh? 
Leave it to me!

00:14:02.510 --> 00:14:04.070
That's not the problem!

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:05.220
Iris!

00:14:08.210 --> 00:14:09.320
Good morning!

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:13.020
G-Good morning, Matty!

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:19.210
Your Majesty. Thank you for giving us access 
to the treasury the other day.

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:22.290
You enabled us to defeat Zardias.

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:26.010
No need to thank me. 
The kingdom was in peril.

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:30.040
It is the duty of a king 
to do his best to save it.

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:34.970
Besides, if I had refused your requests, 
I might have made an enemy of Matthias.

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:40.120
Now, as reward for your deeds,

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:43.060
I'd like to grant you 
a title and lands,

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:46.130
but as I recall, Matthias, 
you had no desire for title, correct?

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:50.180
Yes. I'd like to live my life 
as an adventurer.

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:51.410
I see.

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:55.880
At the very least, I shall let you 
have the sword that Lurie took.

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:59.620
<i>I'm really glad 
he didn't ask me to return it.</i>

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:02.680
<i>Once its magic was gone, 
the sword kind of...</i>

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:07.920
But it simply doesn't feel like enough.

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:10.360
Would you like to have a look 
inside the treasury?

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:13.260
Any of you can take 
anything you like from it.

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:16.170
Yes! I'll always take treasure!

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:17.370
Because I can always sell it!

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:20.730
Wait, Alma! 
You can't just say that!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:23.070
You've gotta take it when they offer!

00:15:23.070 --> 00:15:25.680
Money solves most things 
for you, too, right?

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:27.160
That's true, but...

00:15:27.160 --> 00:15:29.190
I want food!

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:33.910
Then it sounds as though we have an agreement.

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:36.510
Thank you!

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:41.120
Look at all the treasure!

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:43.580
We were in such a hurry 
when we came to get the magic sword

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:45.280
that we didn't have time to look around!

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:47.070
That's so true!

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:49.740
It's all pretty lousy.

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:50.880
Really?

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:55.720
Yeah, any of the weapons here, 
I could just get Lurie to make.

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:58.350
He's not talking about the treasure?

00:16:00.720 --> 00:16:03.330
Nothing really catches my eye.

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:05.940
Iris, your head! Your head!

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:09.140
Hey, when did that get there?

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:11.840
This arrow...

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:13.110
You recognize it?

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:16.740
Well, I was just thinking, if there were a bow 
made of the same material,

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:19.370
it would make great equipment for Alma.

00:16:19.760 --> 00:16:24.120
<i>This is an adamantite alloy arrow 
that I created in my past life.</i>

00:16:24.680 --> 00:16:28.130
<i>I believe I made a matching bow 
for it at the time.</i>

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:31.600
May I ask?

00:16:31.600 --> 00:16:32.450
Yes?

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:35.460
Was there a bow 
that came with this arrow?

00:16:35.460 --> 00:16:36.690
Let me see...

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:39.600
I do believe a bow was brought in 
with the arrow.

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:43.880
It appears the bow was so badly rusted, 
it was declared useless.

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:45.120
So it wouldn't be here.

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:46.730
They didn't throw it away, did they?

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:49.840
It appears it was sold 
to the Isis Company.

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:53.730
They didn't know what the metal was, 
so it apparently sold for cheap.

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:56.540
This is the Isis Company?

00:16:56.540 --> 00:16:57.510
Yes.

00:16:57.510 --> 00:17:00.120
It's the biggest shop in the area,

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:03.870
and it seems they're a major buyer 
of scrap metal from the palace.

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:07.480
Aw, and I thought 
today was gonna be about treasure!

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:10.040
The bow probably isn't even here anymore.

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:11.320
Indeed.

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:15.380
It might not be here 
in its original form anymore.

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:18.350
A bow excavated from ruins?

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:22.640
We heard that 
the castle treasury sold it to you.

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:25.290
Oh, I do remember that!

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:26.530
Really?

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:29.390
I'm believe it's somewhere 
on this shelf...

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:31.070
This is it.

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:36.150
Um, this is...

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:38.400
You've turned it into a block of metal.

00:17:38.400 --> 00:17:41.280
Yes, we couldn't identify the metal,

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:43.700
so we melted it down 
and mixed it with the rest.

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:46.860
I can't fight demons with that!

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:48.670
What will we do, Matty?

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:51.700
<i>I had a feeling 
it would be something like this.</i>

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:57.570
<i>This civilization didn't seem advanced enough 
to be aware of adamantite.</i>

00:17:57.570 --> 00:18:00.720
<i>But since it's mixed in 
with various other metals,</i>

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:04.640
<i>if I can separate them, 
I might end up with other rare metals.</i>

00:18:05.220 --> 00:18:07.480
I'll buy all your metal blocks.

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:08.970
Matty?!

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:11.320
Thank you so much for your purchase!

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:13.500
Now, let's get to the paperwork!

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:15.420
Can I have it sent to my inn?

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:17.100
But of course!

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:23.830
Oh, there you are.

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:25.300
C'mon, Iris, we're going—

00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:27.290
Look at this!

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:30.670
You like this stuff, Iris?

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:34.060
Yes! It's so very beautiful!

00:18:34.060 --> 00:18:36.800
Matthias, I want it!

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:39.300
Are you interested 
in making optical components?

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.040
"Optical components"?

00:18:41.040 --> 00:18:44.330
What do those have to do 
with pretty stones?

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:46.030
<i>Oh, I see...</i>

00:18:46.030 --> 00:18:49.510
<i>Dragons do like 
to collect beautiful things.</i>

00:18:49.510 --> 00:18:51.440
Sparkly!

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:53.820
Very well. I'll buy that, too.

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:56.060
Thank you!

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:58.560
Ahem!

00:18:58.560 --> 00:18:59.890
What is it, Alma?

00:18:59.890 --> 00:19:04.670
It seems a bit gauche 
to be buying jewels only for Iris.

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:11.090
I-I'll buy two jewels, then!

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:12.730
That's not the way!

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:16.160
I see...

00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:18.880
All right. I understand.

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:22.950
I'll try it later.

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:27.800
And I never ended up with my bow...

00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:30.060
There you are, Matthias!

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:32.280
What is it?

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:33.650
We have an emergency situation!

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:39.110
I've brought Matthias and his party.

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:42.580
It's been some time, 
Matthias Hildesheimer.

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:45.610
Er...

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:47.840
Guile, Captain of the Knights' Order!

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:50.160
You really should remember it already.

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:52.180
Have you heard the situation?

00:19:52.180 --> 00:19:52.970
Yes.

00:19:52.970 --> 00:19:54.750
The headmaster explained on the way.

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:56.880
It's about this, isn't it?

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:57.960
Yes.

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:01.740
Two days ago, 
we received report of an attack

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:04.150
near the border with our neighbor, 
the Syhill Empire.

00:20:04.150 --> 00:20:06.130
By three hundred of these puppets.

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:09.750
This casting circle is quite intricate.

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:12.030
The material itself is ordinary wood,

00:20:12.030 --> 00:20:14.170
but I think 
it would have increased its durability.

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:18.460
And the puppet is powered by...

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:22.450
Human life energy.

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:24.780
"Human life energy"?!

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:28.620
You mean, someone was killed 
in order to animate this puppet?

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:34.080
No, the puppet isn't powerful enough 
to be worth sacrificing an entire human being.

00:20:34.410 --> 00:20:36.940
More likely, it's stealing small amounts 
of life energy,

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:39.550
gradually, from many humans at once.

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:42.080
The only one who could do 
something like that is...

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:44.050
Yes, a demon.

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:48.050
Are you suggesting that 
they could be in control of the Syhill Empire?

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:51.530
Getting humans to fight each other 
to gradually weaken them

00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:53.620
is a standard demon tactic.

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:55.460
Matthias Hildesheimer.

00:20:56.050 --> 00:20:58.010
For the sake of the Kingdom of Eis...

00:20:58.010 --> 00:21:01.290
No, for the sake of all humanity...

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:03.610
Can we ask for your aid once again?

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:05.540
Of course.

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:14.310
What did you want to talk to me about?

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:16.290
Er, well...

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:19.250
Are you hiding something, Matty?

00:21:20.020 --> 00:21:21.400
L-Lurie...

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:22.420
Yes?

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:25.970
Would you... close your eyes a moment?

00:21:28.070 --> 00:21:29.430
Like this?

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:31.970
Keep them closed until I say so.

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:32.890
I will.

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:38.210
<i>Is... Is he going to...</i>

00:21:39.910 --> 00:21:43.700
<i>I'm not prepared...!</i>

00:21:45.980 --> 00:21:47.160
You can open them now.

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:56.160
Is this...

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:58.380
You were looking at the jewels 
in that store,

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:00.250
so I thought you might like it.

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:04.080
I was told you might prefer it 
in a form that you could wear,

00:22:04.080 --> 00:22:06.510
so I shaped it into a pendant.

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:10.550
But if you don't want it, 
you can always get rid of it...

00:22:14.850 --> 00:22:17.350
I love it.

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:21.380
I'm so happy to get 
such a wonderful present from you, Matty.

00:22:21.380 --> 00:22:24.080
I'll always treasure it!

00:22:31.140 --> 00:22:33.410
The moment the expeditionary force is ready,

00:22:33.410 --> 00:22:35.200
we'll come after you.

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:37.490
You heard the man.

00:22:37.490 --> 00:22:41.920
Iris, Alma, Lurie, and Matthias!

00:22:43.060 --> 00:22:44.250
I'm counting on you all!

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:45.040
Right!

00:22:45.040 --> 00:22:46.620
Okay!

00:22:50.250 --> 00:22:53.080
A demon controlling the Syhill Empire...

00:22:53.080 --> 00:22:55.190
It may be a difficult opponent.

00:22:55.190 --> 00:22:57.680
But we can't just run away.

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:00.350
Not as long as 
someone out there is suffering!

00:23:00.350 --> 00:23:01.740
Don't you worry!

00:23:01.740 --> 00:23:04.680
We already beat that Zarry guy!

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:09.160
<i>Just before he died, he said</i>

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:13.070
<i>that he wasn't the only chaos demon 
out there.</i>

00:23:14.860 --> 00:23:19.830
<i>It seems there are many powerful opponents 
that I don't know about in this world.</i>

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:21.860
What's wrong, Matty?

00:23:30.610 --> 00:23:31.760
Let's go.

00:23:33.290 --> 00:23:36.560
<i>This adventure is only going 
to get more entertaining!</i>
